Seika_Frostmere_House3_Text_Npc0::
	.string "The old songs say a bell once\n"
	.string "rang on top of MT. SKYREACH.\p"
	.string "When it rang, the WISHING STAR\n"
	.string "woke and came down to listen.\p"
	.string "A bell of starglass, they said.\n"
	.string "Who knows if it was real?$"
	.string "{JPN}{JPN}ふるい　うたでは　ソラトドキやまの　てっぺんで\n"
	.string "むかし　かねが　なったと　いう。\p"
	.string "かねが　なると　ねがいぼしが　めを　さまし\n"
	.string "ききに　おりて　きたそうじゃ。\p"
	.string "ほしガラスで　できた　かねじゃと。　ほんとうか\n"
	.string "どうかは　わからんがのう。$"
